o a foreign namespace (such as <mglyph> or <malignmark> fostered under <mtext>), causing a parser to resolve the subtree in a different foreign namespace upon re-parsing the rendered output.\n\nContinue walking the full ancestor chain and verify that every transition from a non-empty namespace occurs at an HTML integration point before emitting literal text.","cvss":[{"source":"134c704f-9b21-4f2e-91b3-4a467353bcc0","type":"Secondary","version":"3.1","vector":"CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:R/S:C/C:L/I:L/A:N","metrics":{"baseScore":6.1,"exploitabilityScore":2.9,"impactScore":2.8},"vendorMetadata":{}}],"epss":[{"cve":"CVE-2026-97045","epss":0.00267,"percentile":0.18942,"date":"2026-11-06"}],"cwes":[{"cve":"CVE-2026-97045","cwe":"CWE-79","source":"134c704f-9b21-4f2e-91b3-4a467353bcc0","type":"Secondary"}],"fix":{"versions":["0.62.0"],"state":"fixed","available":[{"version":"0.62.0","date":"2026-10-27","kind":"release"}]},"advisories":[],"risk":0.14818499999999998},"relatedVulnerabilities":[{"id":"CVE-2026-97045","dataSource":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-97045","namespace":"nvd:cpe","severity":"Medium","urls":["https://go.dev/cl/855121","https://go.dev/issue/82622","https://groups.google.com/g/golang-announce/c/sqrs2vTx_Xs","https://pkg.go.dev/vuln/GO-2026-6866"],"description":"In childTextNodesAreLiteral, walking up the tree previously stopped at the nearest foreign ancestor once an HTML integration point was found. However, that integration point may itself be a descendant of an element that was foster-parented into a foreign namespace (such as <mglyph> or <malignmark> fostered under <mtext>), causing a parser to resolve the subtree in a different foreign namespace upon re-parsing the rendered output. Continue walking the full ancestor chain and verify that every transition from a non-empty namespace occurs at an HTML integration point before emitting literal text.","cvss":[{"source":"134c704f-9b21-4f2e-91b3-4a467353bcc0","type":"Secondary","version":"3.1","